# Porter

> Porter is a platform as a service (PaaS) that runs applications in your own AWS, GCP, or Azure account while managing the underlying infrastructure.

## Documentation

- [Agent index](https://docs.porter.run/llms.txt): Full documentation index and agent instructions for operating Porter applications and clusters.

## Agent tooling

Install the Porter CLI, register Porter's MCP server with the agent clients on this machine, and install Porter's skills:

`curl -fsSL https://agents.porter.run | sh`

Restart the agent client afterward.
